I have to turn him around.

01:13:14.970 --> 01:13:15.490
You can't.

01:13:15.860 --> 01:13:16.380
It's too late now.

01:13:16.790 --> 01:13:17.110
No.

01:13:18.040 --> 01:13:19.900
He saved my life and I'll save his.

01:13:22.010 --> 01:13:22.450
Akemi!

01:13:32.710 --> 01:13:33.210
Akemi!

01:13:43.180 --> 01:13:43.500
Go on.

01:13:44.070 --> 01:13:44.430
Get off.

01:14:07.700 --> 01:14:08.240
Silly enough.

01:14:09.470 --> 01:14:10.450
Don't you know that a run here...

01:14:12.340 --> 01:14:12.620
Hey.

01:14:14.230 --> 01:14:15.790
Come on now, does he really mean that much to you?

01:14:17.530 --> 01:14:17.850
Okay.

01:14:19.360 --> 01:14:20.340
Okay, I'll help you find him.

01:14:21.880 --> 01:14:23.420
But just remember, he's not a toy poodle.

01:15:01.450 --> 01:15:01.610
Thank you.

01:15:01.720 --> 01:15:02.180
Thank you.

01:15:07.990 --> 01:15:08.470
It's the green.

01:15:08.790 --> 01:15:09.270
Get out of here.

01:15:43.400 --> 01:15:43.720
This way.

01:17:30.220 --> 01:17:30.700
Come on, follow me.

01:18:42.410 --> 01:18:42.550
me

01:18:50.440 --> 01:18:51.180
You feeling all right now?

01:18:51.850 --> 01:18:52.250
Yes.

01:18:52.620 --> 01:18:53.040
Gary.

01:18:54.630 --> 01:18:56.890
beginning to think I lost an assistant there for a while.

01:18:59.720 --> 01:18:59.920
Bye.

01:19:00.000 --> 01:19:00.660
By the way, that...

01:19:01.140 --> 01:19:03.080
That big brown teddy bear came to your rescue again.

01:19:04.120 --> 01:19:05.520
I'm beginning to think he's got a crush on you.

01:20:00.120 --> 01:20:01.120
Can't you spare him one hour, General?

01:20:03.500 --> 01:20:04.580
Even thirty minutes, then.

01:20:04.800 --> 01:20:07.060
I'm sure he came to stop the Green Gargantua.

01:20:08.530 --> 01:20:09.860
Sorry, we can't.

01:20:09.920 --> 01:20:13.790
Give him a chance, General.

01:20:15.000 --> 01:20:17.460
He deserves at least that much for saving Akami's life again.

01:20:17.680 --> 01:20:19.200
If we do, we can lose them both.

01:20:19.400 --> 01:20:26.040
Minute to zero.

01:21:41.700 --> 01:21:42.160
Sorry, Kami.

01:21:43.660 --> 01:21:46.300
I did the best I could do. I called everyone but the SPCA.

01:21:49.260 --> 01:21:52.900
The only thing we can do now is hope that the brown one survives and that the cells don't mold.

01:22:49.510 --> 01:22:50.270
All right, keep us posted.

01:22:51.500 --> 01:22:53.060
The battle's moving out toward the port, sir.

01:22:54.600 --> 01:22:55.660
How can they stand up?

01:22:56.710 --> 01:22:58.390
against such tremendous firepower.

01:23:31.020 --> 01:23:31.280
I mean,

01:27:01.720 --> 01:27:01.960
Oh, my God.

01:28:43.500 --> 01:28:44.220
Hello, doctor.

01:28:51.750 --> 01:28:52.910
Why do they know where the brown one is?

01:28:53.220 --> 01:28:55.580
The helicopters are still searching Tokyo Bay.

01:28:56.360 --> 01:28:57.480
But they can't seem to find them there.

01:28:59.430 --> 01:28:59.890
they may be

01:29:00.000 --> 01:29:06.610
out to sea. I prayed so that I could save his life.

01:31:30.060 --> 01:31:30.360
both.

01:31:31.400 --> 01:31:32.100
Did they confirm it?

01:31:33.100 --> 01:31:33.360
No.

01:31:34.020 --> 01:31:35.780
But no living thing could have survived.
